<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A1.T5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 5</span>: </span><span id="A1.T5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance analysis when integrating merging strategy.</span></figcaption>
