<section id="A1.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.6 </span>Impact of Calibration Data Size</h3>

<div id="A1.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To analyze the impact of calibration data size, we randomly sampled 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, and 1024 sequences from C4 dataset <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib35" title="" class="ltx_ref">35</a>]</cite> to learn DiEP’s intra-layer scores (<math id="A1.SS6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>) and inter-layer scores <math id="A1.SS6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math>. As shown in Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.6 Impact of Calibration Data Size ‣ Appendix A Experimental Appendices ‣ DiEP: Adaptive Mixture-of-Experts Compression through Differentiable Expert Pruning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, 128 sequences achieve optimal performance when pruning Mixtral 8<math id="A1.SS6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math>7B from 8 to 6 experts. More importantly, DiEP avoids performance collapse with only 32 samples. We attribute it to KD regularization enforcing DiEP’s features aligned with the full model.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A1.T6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="A1.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performances of expert pruning when changing the number of samples in the calibration dataset.</span></figcaption>
<div id="A1.T6.5" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:207.0pt;height:63.7pt;vertical-align:-30.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-35.0pt,10.8pt) scale(0.747523534767714,0.747523534767714) ;">
